---
/* 11.2: logic with switches. Two switches in series light the lamp only if
   A and B are closed (E); two in parallel light it if A or B is closed (OU). */
const sw = (x: number, y: number, label: string) => `
  <circle cx="${x}" cy="${y}" r="3" class="dot"/>
  <circle cx="${x + 30}" cy="${y}" r="3" class="dot"/>
  <path d="M${x} ${y}L${x + 26} ${y - 12}" class="blade"/>
  <text x="${x + 15}" y="${y + 20}" class="lab">${label}</text>`;
const lamp = (x: number, y: number) => `
  <circle cx="${x}" cy="${y}" r="13" class="lampb"/>
  <path d="M${x - 9} ${y - 9}L${x + 9} ${y + 9}M${x + 9} ${y - 9}L${x - 9} ${y + 9}" class="line"/>`;
const battery = (x: number, y: number) => `
  <path d="M${x - 12} ${y - 4}H${x + 12}M${x - 7} ${y + 4}H${x + 7}" class="bat"/>
  <text x="${x - 18}" y="${y - 2}" class="lab end">+</text>`;
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 640 210" width="640" height="210" class="fig" aria-hidden="true">
  <text x="150" y="20" class="title">E: chaves em série</text>
  <text x="480" y="20" class="title">OU: chaves em paralelo</text>
  <g>
    <path d="M40 60H70M100 60H140M170 60H230V97M230 123V180H40V114M40 106V60" class="line" />
    <Fragment set:html={sw(70, 60, 'A')} />
    <Fragment set:html={sw(140, 60, 'B')} />
    <Fragment set:html={lamp(230, 110)} />
    <Fragment set:html={battery(40, 110)} />
    <text x="150" y="202" class="note">acende só se A E B estiverem fechadas</text>
  </g>
  <g transform="translate(330 0)">
    <path
      d="M40 60H90M120 60H170V97M170 123V180H40V114M40 106V60M60 60V110H90M120 110H150V60"
      class="line"
    />
    <Fragment set:html={sw(90, 60, 'A')} />
    <Fragment set:html={sw(90, 110, 'B')} />
    <Fragment set:html={lamp(170, 110)} />
    <Fragment set:html={battery(40, 110)} />
    <text x="150" y="202" class="note">acende se A OU B (ou as duas) estiverem fechadas</text>
  </g>
</svg>

<style>
  .fig {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .fig :global(.line) {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--fg);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .fig :global(.blade) {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 3;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .fig :global(.dot) {
    fill: var(--fg);
  }
  .fig :global(.bat) {
    stroke: var(--fg);
    stroke-width: 3;
  }
  .fig :global(.lampb) {
    fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--warning) 25%, var(--bg));
    stroke: var(--fg);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .fig :global(.lab) {
    fill: var(--fg);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }
  .fig :global(.end) {
    text-anchor: end;
  }
  .title {
    fill: var(--fg);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }
  .note {
    fill: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }
</style>
